    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-17",
      "text": "金山寺的钟声响起，少年玄奘坐在潭边，看波纹一点点刷过自己的倒影；老方丈不知何时站在他背后，合掌长叹。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000066.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000066",
          "chapter_order": 66,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "金山寺的钟声惊动了林中的潭水"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-18",
      "text": "老方丈问玄奘看着潭水能看出什么；玄奘答「我在想，它是从哪里来的」，老方丈答「从造化中来」。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "老方丈"
      },
      "revealed_at": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000066.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000066",
          "chapter_order": 66,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "“从造化中来。”"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-19",
      "text": "玄奘追问造化又从哪里来；一滴叶上露珠落到他掌心，他倾掌使水珠顺指尖落入潭中溅起涟漪，长老说「造化就在掌心吧」。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "老方丈"
      },
      "revealed_at": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000066.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000066",
          "chapter_order": 66,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "“造化就在掌心吧。”"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-20",
      "text": "玄奘追问这潭是谁掌心上的一滴水、它日后会变成大海还是泥坑、江水滔滔的源头是什么、他自己的源头是什么、他成为海还是泥坑又是谁的造化；老方丈以「江流」称呼他，说他还小不要想得太多。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0053/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0053"
      },
      "revealed_at": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000066.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000066",
          "chapter_order": 66,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "“江流，”老方丈说"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-21",
      "text": "玄奘对师父说「我总觉得，自己已经出世了一万年」。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0053/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0053"
      },
      "revealed_at": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000066.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000066",
          "chapter_order": 66,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "自己已经出世了一万年"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-22",
      "text": "黑暗中有宏远的声音称玄奘为「金蝉子」，问他在世间游历这么久是否准备好他的法论。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "宏远声音（第66章称玄奘为金蝉子者）"
      },
      "revealed_at": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000066.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000066",
          "chapter_order": 66,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "“金蝉子，你在世间游历了这么久？"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-23",
      "text": "玄奘听到那个回答的声音后微笑了。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0053/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0053"
      },
      "revealed_at": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000066.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000066",
          "chapter_order": 66,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "玄奘听到这个声音，微笑了。"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-24",
      "text": "一个声音说「我突然不想论什么了」，称自己永远无法用语言表述一棵树的生长、一朵花的全貌，只问「生命的真义是什么」并请求不要用语言来回答。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "答者声音（第66章拒以语言论道者）"
      },
      "revealed_at": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000066.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000066",
          "chapter_order": 66,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "生命的真义是什么，请不要用语言来告诉我。"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-25",
      "text": "四周忽然全亮，玄奘身处于一座宝殿之中。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000066.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000066",
          "chapter_order": 66,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "忽然四周全亮了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-26",
      "text": "金殿上的皇帝说「观音大士现身，命朕寻你去西天取经」。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "皇帝"
      },
      "revealed_at": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000066.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000066",
          "chapter_order": 66,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "观音大士现身，命朕寻你去西天取经"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-27",
      "text": "玄奘回答皇帝「我不去」「我没时间」，并称「可是佛不让我去」，把自己所说的佛称作「我心自在佛」。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0053/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0053"
      },
      "revealed_at": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000066.txt",
