      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-31",
      "text": "皇帝说玄奘也该去灵山见佛祖受他点拨，并称经在西天、想必一直向西便是；玄奘反问「何处是灵山」「西天在何处」，并表示若找不到西天自然不配受此经。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "皇帝"
      },
      "revealed_at": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000066.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000066",
          "chapter_order": 66,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "想必一直向西便是了吧。"
